 "description": "Defined DNRA medium, whole-cell H2-oxidation kinetics assay (1 mM acetate/2 mM NO3- pregrowth, then 10 mM NO2- + variable H2 100-100,000 ppmv), medium reported in PMC12286921, extracted for GrowthDB and mapped to BiGG.",
